# Building a Scalable and Secure Multi-VPC AWS Network Infrastructure AWS Whitepaper

> This whitepaper describes best practices for creating scalable and secure network architectures in a large network using AWS services like Amazon VPC, AWS Transit Gateway, AWS PrivateLink, and Direct Connect Gateway.

- [Abstract and introduction](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/whitepapers/latest/building-scalable-secure-multi-vpc-network-infrastructure/welcome.md)
- [DNS](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/whitepapers/latest/building-scalable-secure-multi-vpc-network-infrastructure/dns.md)
- [Centralized access to VPC private endpoints](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/whitepapers/latest/building-scalable-secure-multi-vpc-network-infrastructure/centralized-access-to-vpc-private-endpoints.md)
- [Conclusion](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/whitepapers/latest/building-scalable-secure-multi-vpc-network-infrastructure/conclusion.md)
- [Contributors](https://docs.aws.amazon.com/whitepapers/latest/building-scalable-secure-multi-vpc-network-infrastructure/contributors.md)
